Avoid Unsafe Functions
Unsafe	Safe Alternative
gets()	fgets(buf, size, stdin)
strcpy()	strncpy() or strlcpy() (if available)
sprintf()	snprintf()
strcat()	strncat()
scanf("%s", buf)	scanf("%99s", buf) or fgets
Always specify the maximum length to avoid overflow.
